      "title": "Gitlab-CI: Merge request - Check doxygen for modified files",
      "message": "Gitlab-CI: Merge request - Check doxygen for modified files\n\nFor merge requests, check if modified files were documented with doxygen\nThis job will fail if a file was not documented, but failure is\nallowed.\n",
